          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Scent",
            "use_variant_metafield": true,
            "variant_metafield": "scent.description",
            "richtext": "<p><strong>Santal Dune: </strong>Warm amber and smooth santal finished with earthy spice.</p><p><strong>Bergamot Canyon:</strong> Bright citrus and neroli with a crisp oakmoss and bergamot finish</p>"
          }
        },
        "accordion_t949tM": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How to Use",
            "use_variant_metafield": false,
            "variant_metafield": "scent",
            "richtext": "<p><strong>Step 1:<br/></strong>Remove top and twist the bottom until formula begins to appear from perforated cap (Don’t overtwist! A little goes a long way)</p><p><strong>Step 2:</strong><br/>Apply formula directly on clean, dry underarms – damp skin reduces effectiveness.</p><p><strong>Step 3:</strong><br/>Apply formula directly on underarm</p><p>For best results, keep deodorant at room temperature (68°F to 77°F / 20°C to 25°C)</p>"
          }
        },
